WEBVTT

00:05:28.396 --> 00:05:33.436
Each one of us is in some way
an ambassador of our species.

00:05:34.236 --> 00:05:40.396
And as we walk, we have a chance
to activate the best of ourselves.

00:05:41.036 --> 00:05:44.076
The qualities of awakening.

00:05:44.716 --> 00:05:46.436
Endurance.

00:05:46.796 --> 00:05:48.316
Compassion.

00:05:48.916 --> 00:05:50.396
Generosity.

00:05:51.316 --> 00:05:53.996
Fearlessness and hope.

00:05:56.596 --> 00:06:00.796
And going further, as we walk, we realize